<title>POLAND: CITIBANK POLAND SELLS PLN 17.5 MLN CONT. CAN CPS.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK POLAND SELLS PLN 17.5 MLN CONT. CAN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Poland placed 17.5 million worth of three-month commercial papers for Continental Can Polska, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank said the offering was 57 percent oversubscribed and was part of a 30 million-mark borrowing programme for the Polish subsidiary of the German Schmalbach-Lubeca Group packaging company.</p>
<p>Citibank would not disclose the price of the papers.</p>
<p>It said the next issuance was due by December 19.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
